AlkylationReagent: iodoacetamide
CleavageAgent: trypsin
CollisionEnergy: normalized fragmentation energy at 27%
Disease: dust mite allergies
FlowRateChromatogram: 300 nl/min
GradientTime: 120 min
Instrument: Q Exactive Orbitrap mass spectrometer (Thermo Fisher Scientific)
IonizationType: nano electrospray
Modification: carbamidomethylation (C)
Modification: deamidation (NQ)
Modification: oxidation (M)
NumberOfSamples: 16
Organism: Dermatophagoides pteronyssinus
Organism: Dermatophagoides farinae
Organism: Suidasia medanensis
Organism: Cicer arietinum
Organism: Blomia tropicalis
ReductionReagent: dithiothreitol
Separation: reverse-phase nano-HPLC (Dionex Ultimate 3000, Thermo Fisher Scientific, Bremen, Germany)
Separation: Acclaim PepMap RSLC C18, 75 μm × 15 cm, Dionex, Thermo Fisher Scientific
